From 31465bf26d8cccdf03bc3d2a3dcc17df831f18a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZhangDM-520 <jixianqiang1540@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:46:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] feat(title_bar): sample 1-4 rows of the window edge, one
 by default

Five rows stretched over the bar kept the top row of the window's own UI
legible inside it, so tab rows and buttons along that edge read as fragments
of themselves rather than as a colour. The sample is now a setting,
`color_source_height`, from 1 to 4 rows and 1 by default: one row is a single
flat colour, a larger value keeps more of the edge.

Pins: a unit case for the one-row strip, and a harness phase that switches the
height live (3 rows reaches into the window body, 1 row does not).

